; ABNF-style descriptive mirror of `stdio.semio`'s real `SemioMutation` binary frame (past the
; `semio_format` envelope) -- see the authoritative `📡️.protocol.semio` for the
; conformance-tested version.
document = format tag payload
format   = %x01                  ; OP_BINARY_FORMAT
tag      = OCTET                 ; mutation variant ordinal (0=SetSnapshot, 1-18=subset)
payload  = *OCTET                ; opaque tail: wrapped subset's own real encode_op()/encode_pack() bytes
